<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Elandsrand, Deelkraal talks continue.</title>
<headline>Elandsrand, Deelkraal talks continue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African firm Elandsrand Gold Mining Co said on Friday that its talks with Deelkraal Gold Mining Co Ltd are continuing.</p>
<p>&quot;Caution should continue to be exercised when dealing in shares of the company,&quot; the firm added.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
